ro known toxicity at recommended doses.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="14f2da79-4e1b-40c3-8eaa-e91b0f66538c" class="r-f1fpk" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="9ce04b38-eaa9-476d-84df-c6a64071bada" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R1jbj2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-14eimoc"><div data-rid="df1f92d4-9c13-458a-b72d-58bcfc412d32" class="r-uqtfn2 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>6. How is this different from Haritaki powder?</p></span></div><div data-rid="3c19a718-584c-4a0d-bd2f-3763b7de1094" class="r-151f81h" aria-hidden="true"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:auto;max-height:100%" class="r-jb98it" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"></path></svg></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R1jbj2:"><div data-rid="f2ed38a3-5545-4a74-b76d-a155af18ad95" class="r-1sdfhir"><div data-rid="fc7102a9-4a54-45dc-845e-517e82e007cb" class="r-9zxar1 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Powder tastes terrible and oxidizes quickly. Capsules = consistent dose, no bitter taste, stays potent longer.</p></span></div></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="2b0d870b-fb30-4539-ae54-60439504cdb3" class="r-mvxtgc"><div data-rid="80474d73-71ad-45e8-85de-7de654551258" class="r-n4tahh" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="fb74b693-de82-4b10-8528-301e0f876afb" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:Rdbj2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1papsvg"><div data-rid="24c081f5-ce7d-4178-bad8-c1a0219bef5e" class="r-1fpfq6m alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>7. Can I take it if I'm sensitive to detox effects?</p></span></div><div data-rid="3cc44dae-4d2a-4cd